# 039-options.lua

Plain data for the options tally (`scripts/tally-options`): returns a list
of the room tree's undecided choices, one table each, in the shape given in
`docs/phase-1-module-contract.md` ("The options tally").

| id | waits on | config key |
|---|---|---|
| `tree-parent-disclosure` | owner (open question 3) | `tree.parent-disclosure` |
| `tree-disclosure-refresh` | state (phase 2 delivery) | — |
| `tree-where-per-recipient` | owner | — |
| `tree-slash-in-path` | state (101's `rooms.slash-in-name`) | — |
| `tree-untell-on-removal` | state (phase 2, issue 103's split) | — |
